nvertible` element -/\n  invOf : α\n  /-- `invOf a` is a left inverse of `a` -/\n  invOf_mul_self : invOf * a = 1\n  /-- `invOf a` is a right inverse of `a` -/\n  mul_invOf_self : a * invOf = 1","start":86,"end":93},"axioms":[]}